      "text": "Timeline chart of a sample consolidated work plan over years 0–10, with activity areas grouped into four action lines: foundations (e.g. UHI, NASH, NHIRF, eHealth standards, physical infrastructure), eHealth solutions, change and adoption (e.g. awareness campaigns, incentives, accreditation, education and training) and governance. Bars show the timing of each activity.",
